      "preview": "חֶ֫דֶר: câmara, aposento.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֫דֶר</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.11\">1 Ch 28:11</a> <strong>câmara, aposento (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem;</em> fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">חדר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חדרת</span>; sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">חֿדר</span> Mordt<sup>ZMG, 1876, 24</sup>; etíope ማኅደር ማኅደር não é 'câmara', mas (da raiz ኀደረ <em>habitar</em>) <em>morada, habitação, tenda</em>.<strong>)</strong> absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶדֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.10\">2 S 13:10</a> + 11 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחַ֫דְרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:30\" href=\"/Genesis.43.30\">Gn 43:30</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.15\">1 K 1:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶחָ֑דְרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:1\" href=\"/Judges.15.1\">Ju 15:1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.10\">2 S 13:10</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֫דֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.4\">Ct 3:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲדַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:28\" href=\"/Exodus.7.28\">Ex 7:28</a> + 5 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶדְרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:16\" href=\"/Joel.2.16\">Jo 2:16</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲדָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.25\">Dt 32:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.4\">Pr 24:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.4\">Pr 24:4</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדְרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.27\">Pr 7:27</a> + 8 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲדָרֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.20\">Is 26:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲדָרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.4\">Ct 1:4</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.11\">1 Ch 28:11</a>;—<em>aposento, câmara</em>, geralmente particular, como quarto de dormir <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:30\" href=\"/Genesis.43.30\">Gn 43:30</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:1\" href=\"/Judges.15.1\">Ju 15:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:9\" href=\"/Judges.16.9\">16:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:12\" href=\"/Judges.16.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.10\">2 S 13:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.15\">1 K 1:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.4\">Ct 1:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.20\">Is 26:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:18\" href=\"/Judges.14.18\">Ju 14:18</a> ler provavelmente <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחַדְרָה</span> <em>câmara nupcial</em> por <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחַרְסָה</span> Sta<sup>ZAW 1884, 253</sup>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:16\" href=\"/Joel.2.16\">Jo 2:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻפָּתָהּ</span> da noiva), <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הוֹרָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.4\">Ct 3:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית אִמִּי</span>); de reis (do Egito) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:30\" href=\"/Psalms.105.30\">ψ 105:30</a>; especificamente: <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מִשְׁכָּב</span> <em>câmara de dormir</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:28\" href=\"/Exodus.7.28\">Ex 7:28</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.7\">2 S 4:7</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.12\">2 K 6:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:20\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.20\">Ec 10:20</a>; outras combinações:—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַמְּקֵרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:24\" href=\"/Judges.3.24\">Ju 3:24</a> = <em>câmara fresca;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַפְּנִימִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.11\">1 Ch 28:11</a> <em>câmara interior;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">חדרי מַשְׂבִּיתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.12\">Ez 8:12</a> <em>suas câmaras de imagens</em> (suprimido por Hi Co Sgfr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ בְּח׳</span> <em>uma câmara dentro de uma câmara</em>, isto é, câmara mais recôndita <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.30\">1 K 20:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.25\">22:25</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.24\">2 Ch 18:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.2\">2 K 9:2</a>; plural = <em>depósitos</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.4\">Pr 24:4</a>; assim <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַמִּטּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.2\">2 K 11:2</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.11\">2 Ch 22:11</a>, isto é, aposento onde se guardavam leitos (Ke Th); metaforicamente <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מָ֑וֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.27\">Pr 7:27</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּרְכֵי שְׁאוֹל</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">חדרי תֵּמָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:9\" href=\"/Job.9.9\">Jb 9:9</a> <em>câmaras do sul</em> (onde se guardam as constelações, ver Di; Hoffm. pensa em nome próprio de estrela ou constelação); cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 37:9\" href=\"/Job.37.9\">Jb 37:9</a> uma <em>câmara</em> de onde vem o vento tempestuoso <span dir=\"rtl\">(סוּפָה)</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדְרֵי בֶטֶן</span> isto é, partes interiores do corpo, somente em figura <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.8\">Pr 18:8</a> = <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.22\">26:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.27\">20:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.30\">30</a>; em <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.25\">Dt 32:25</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵחֲדָרִים</span> = <em>por dentro</em>, poeticamente por <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבַּיִת</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִחוּץ</span> <em>por fora</em>.",
