      "preview": "חָדַשׁ: renovar, reparar.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָדַשׁ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo.</strong> somente <strong>Pi.</strong> (e <strong>Hithp.</strong>) <strong>renovar, reparar</strong> (poético e tardio) <strong>(</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem.</em>, fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">חדש</span>; substantivo <span dir=\"rtl\">חדש</span> <em>lua nova</em>, também em <span dir=\"rtl\">קרתחדשת</span> <em>cidade nova</em> = <em>Cartago;</em> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">حَدَثَ</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדֵּשׁ</span>; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܰܕܶܬ</span> <em>ser novo</em>, etíope ሐደሰ I. 2. <em>renovar;</em> sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">החדתֿ</span>, ver Os (Levy)<sup>ZMG 1865, 204</sup> Mordt<sup>ZMG 1876, 30</sup>; assírio [<em>adâšu</em>], <em>uddiš</em>, <em>renovar</em>, <em>eššu</em>, <em>novo</em>, etc. Dl<sup>W 199 ff.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחִדְּשׁוּ</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.4\">Is 61:4</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְחַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.8\">2 Ch 15:8</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 10:17\" href=\"/Job.10.17\">Jb 10:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:30\" href=\"/Psalms.104.30\">ψ 104:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וּנְחַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.14\">1 S 11:14</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">חַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:12\" href=\"/Psalms.51.12\">ψ 51:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:21\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.21\">La 5:21</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחַדֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.4\">2 Ch 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.12\">12</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>renovar, fazer de novo</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּלוּכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.14\">1 S 11:14</a> (editorial); <span dir=\"rtl\">פני אדמה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:30\" href=\"/Psalms.104.30\">ψ 104:30</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:12\" href=\"/Psalms.51.12\">51:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בּרא</span>); = trazer de volta <span dir=\"rtl\">יָמֵינוּ כְּקֶדֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:21\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.21\">La 5:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ עדיך</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 10:17\" href=\"/Job.10.17\">Jb 10:17</a> isto é, <em>trazes outras</em> (<em>novas</em>) <em>testemunhas</em>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>reparar</em>, cidades <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.4\">Is 61:4</a>, templo <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.4\">2 Ch 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.12\">12</a>, altar <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.8\">2 Ch 15:8</a>.<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  Imperfeito 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְחַדֵּשׁ</span> com sujeito plural <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ כַּנֶּשֶׁר נְעוּרָ֑יְכִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:5\" href=\"/Psalms.103.5\">ψ 103:5</a> <em>tua juventude se renova, como a águia</em>.",
