      "ordinal": 2884,
      "headword": "חִידָה",
      "ref": "BDB, חִידָה",
      "preview": "חִידָה: enigma, dito ou pergunta enigmática, desconcertante.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חִידָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: enigma, dito ou pergunta enigmática, desconcertante</strong>;—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:12\" href=\"/Judges.14.12\">Ju 14:12</a> + 6 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חִידָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:18\" href=\"/Judges.14.18\">Ju 14:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:5\" href=\"/Psalms.49.5\">ψ 49:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חִידָֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:13\" href=\"/Judges.14.13\">Ju 14:13</a>; plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">חִידוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.1\">1 K 10:1</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חִידֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:8\" href=\"/Numbers.12.8\">Nu 12:8</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חִידֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.6\">Pr 1:6</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>enigma</em> = enunciado obscuro, incompreensível <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:8\" href=\"/Numbers.12.8\">Nu 12:8</a> (JE; oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּה־אֶל־פֶּה</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְאֶה</span>); de algo expresso indiretamente e que requer interpretação;—uma alegoria <span dir=\"rtl\">חוד ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.2\">Ez 17:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשֹׁל מָשָׁל</span>); ditos alegóricos e figurados <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.6\">Pr 1:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְלִיצָה מָשָׁל</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבְרֵי חֲכָמִים</span>); sentenças e comparações enigmáticas, declarando o destino dos caldeus <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:6\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.6\">Hb 2:6</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְלִיצָה</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָשָׁל</span>), problema moral desconcertante <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:5\" href=\"/Psalms.49.5\">ψ 49:5</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּתַח</span> <em>abrir, propor;</em> ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָשָׁל</span>), uma lição ensinada indiretamente <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:2\" href=\"/Psalms.78.2\">ψ 78:2</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מִנִּי קֶדֶם</span>, com <span dir=\"rtl\">הִבִּיעַ</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָשָׁל</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>adivinha, enigma</em>, a ser decifrado, em <a data-ref=\"Judges 14\" href=\"/Judges.14\">Ju 14</a>: <strong>a.</strong>  com verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:12\" href=\"/Judges.14.12\">Ju 14:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:13\" href=\"/Judges.14.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:16\" href=\"/Judges.14.16\">16</a> <em>propor um enigma</em>. <strong>b.</strong>  com verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">הִגִּיד</span> <em>dizer</em> (dar resposta a) <em>um enigma</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:14\" href=\"/Judges.14.14\">Ju 14:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:15\" href=\"/Judges.14.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:17\" href=\"/Judges.14.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:19\" href=\"/Judges.14.19\">19</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  com verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">מצא</span> <em>decifrar um enigma</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:18\" href=\"/Judges.14.18\">Ju 14:18</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>perguntas desconcertantes</em> com que a rainha de Sabá pôs Salomão à prova <span dir=\"rtl\">(נִסָּה)</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.1\">1 K 10:1</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.1\">2 Ch 9:1</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  com <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵבִין</span> hábil em <em>duplicidade</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:23\" href=\"/Daniel.8.23\">Dn 8:23</a> (Bev).",
