      "preview": "חִוִּי: adjetivo gentílico: heveu.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חִוִּי</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo gentílico. (</strong>= <em>aldeões</em>?<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֶם בֶּן־חֲמוֹר הַח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:2\" href=\"/Genesis.34.2\">Gn 34:2</a> (P), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִבְעוֹן הַח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:2\" href=\"/Genesis.36.2\">36:2</a> (mas ler antes <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹרִי</span> Ol Di cf. 𝔊 <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:7\" href=\"/Joshua.9.7\">Jos 9:7</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  com artigo como nome próprio coletivo <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחִוִּי</span> <em>os heveus</em> 'gerados' por Canaã <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:17\" href=\"/Genesis.10.17\">Gn 10:17</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.15\">1 Ch 1:15</a>; especialmente em lista dos povos cananeus desalojados pelos hebreus <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:8\" href=\"/Exodus.3.8\">Ex 3:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:17\" href=\"/Exodus.3.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:5\" href=\"/Exodus.13.5\">13:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:23\" href=\"/Exodus.23.23\">23:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:28\" href=\"/Exodus.23.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:2\" href=\"/Exodus.33.2\">33:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:11\" href=\"/Exodus.34.11\">34:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.1\">Dt 7:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.17\">20:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:10\" href=\"/Joshua.3.10\">Jos 3:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:1\" href=\"/Joshua.9.1\">9:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:8\" href=\"/Joshua.12.8\">12:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:11\" href=\"/Joshua.24.11\">24:11</a> (todos JED), <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:5\" href=\"/Judges.3.5\">Ju 3:5</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.20\">1 K 9:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.7\">2 Ch 8:7</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרֵי הַח׳ וְהַכְּנַעֲנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.7\">2 S 24:7</a> (notar <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְצַר־צֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צִידוֹן</span>, imediatamente precedentes); aplicado especificamente aos gibeonitas <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:7\" href=\"/Joshua.9.7\">Jos 9:7</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:19\" href=\"/Joshua.11.19\">11:19</a> (D).—Em <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:3\" href=\"/Joshua.11.3\">Jos 11:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:3\" href=\"/Judges.3.3\">Ju 3:3</a> ler provavelmente <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחִתִּי</span> por <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחִוִּי</span> We Mey Bu<sup>Urg. 350</sup>, ver (em parte) 𝔊, Dr sobre <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.1\">Dt 7:1</a>.",
