      "preview": "חוֹחַ: espinheiro, silva; gancho, argola, grilhão.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹחַ</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.9\">2 K 14:9</a></sup> <strong>1. espinheiro, silva</strong>. <strong>2. gancho, argola, grilhão</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:6\" href=\"/Hosea.9.6\">Ho 9:6</a> + 8 vezes; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲוָחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.6\">1 S 13:6</a> (mas ver abaixo), <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:2\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.2\">Ct 2:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.11\">2 Ch 33:11</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>espinheiro, silva</em> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.9\">2 K 14:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.18\">2 Ch 25:18</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (alegoria de Jeoás); coletivo, sinal de desolação <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:6\" href=\"/Hosea.9.6\">Ho 9:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קִמּוֹשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.13\">Is 34:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קִמּוֹשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">סִירִים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 31:40\" href=\"/Job.31.40\">Jb 31:40</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">חִטִּים</span>); em símile do provérbio do insensato <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ עָלָה בְּיַד־שִׁכּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.9\">Pr 26:9</a> <em>um espinheiro chega à mão de um homem embriagado</em> (De Now Str); <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּשׁוֹשַׁנָּה בֵּין הַחוֹחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:2\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.2\">Ct 2:2</a>; <em>espinheiros</em> = <em>matagais</em> como esconderijos <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.6\">1 S 13:6</a> (mas Ew We Dr <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹרִים</span> <em>buracos</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.11\">14:11</a>; ver sob III. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חרר²\" href=\"/BDB,_חרר²\", dir=\"rtl\">חרר</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעָרוֹת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">סְלָעִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צְרִחִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּרוֹת</span>; 𝔊 aqui ἐν τ. μάνδραις; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.11\">14:11</a> ἐκ τ. τρωγλῶν).<br><strong>2.</strong>  tardio, <strong>a.</strong>  <em>gancho</em> ou <em>argola</em>, na mandíbula do crocodilo com <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּקֹּב</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:26\" href=\"/Job.40.26\">Jb 40:26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲתָשִׂים אַגְמֹן בְּאַפּוֹ</span>); de cativo <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּלְכְּדוּ אֶת־מְנַשֶּׁה בַּחֹחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.11\">2 Ch 33:11</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חַח²\" href=\"/BDB,_חַח²\", dir=\"rtl\">חַח</a>).",
